name: Planet Tycoon — planet shop flood
author: corpus
description: >-
  Planet Tycoon makes Planet cards appear 4x more frequently in the shop. Tier-2 voucher:
  requires Planet Merchant bought first, so the earliest practical target is Ante 2.
  RAG aliases: planet flood, hand-level scaling, Constellation fuel, Satellite money.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: PlanetTycoon
    antes: [2]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - joker: Constellation
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Satellite
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - voucher: Observatory
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
